    "_deny_doc": [
      "Deliberately tiny, and NOT written unless `forge permissions --with-deny`",
      "is passed. There is no forge-override for a permission rule: a false",
      "positive here does not annoy the user, it blocks their work with an error",
      "they cannot clear. Only commands with no legitimate agent use belong here.",
      "Everything else is ask."
    ],
